{"unit_id":"Wiselfx__dsh-freeweb#card-zh","repo":"Wiselfx/dsh-freeweb","commit":"bcb5af7c3121d09ec663bae23fb4dbbff61fd28c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-freeweb 是为 DSH 接入网页搜索的插件，通过 web seam 注册 freeweb 搜索提供方。它按优先顺序同时调用两个搜索引擎，一个失败时用后续引擎补位，并按跨引擎共识合并结果、去重和压缩摘要。它还解析部分搜索运算符并对结果做宽松过滤。适合希望在 DSH 的 web_search 中使用多个搜索来源的场景。默认无需密钥；可选 API key 用于提高部分引擎的速率限制。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:30-42","dsh/index.js:95-167"]}
{"unit_id":"Wiselfx__dsh-freeweb#card-en","repo":"Wiselfx/dsh-freeweb","commit":"bcb5af7c3121d09ec663bae23fb4dbbff61fd28c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-freeweb adds web search to DSH. It runs two engines concurrently, replaces failures with later candidates, and merges results by agreement while deduplicating and shortening snippets. It parses search operators and filters results. No key is required; optional keys can raise engine rate limits.","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:30-42","dsh/index.js:95-167"]}
